  "body": "What do we think about using the compat spec to resolve this five year old input bug where chrome paints text over padding, and firefox paints padding over text?:\r\nhttps://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=752790\r\n\r\nFor example, see \r\n![ff-chrome-txt-height](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/122117/29188784-480ea6b4-7de2-11e7-9e95-454d41d1569e.png)\r\n\r\nReproduce this with the following CSS:\r\n```\r\ninput {\r\n  height: 50px;  \r\n  padding: 18px;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
